{"2661880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "T-Ghoul :: Dorobou Yameta Youkei Poppu!", "steam_appid": 2661880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661880/extras/943092214f032d52abe49eee40483c80.avif?t=1776427920\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why steal chickens… when you can build a farm?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>T-Ghoul</i>, you play as a mischievous Thai ghoul trying to survive in a modern village that fears her. Tired of haunting and hiding, she dreams of going legit by running her own chicken farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 2D isometric pixel-art horror-comedy blends survival, stealth, and simulation into a satirical take on Thai folklore. Sneak past shamans, manage your undead farm, build relationships with villagers (or betray them), and decide whether to embrace humanity or fully become a creature of the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you thrive peacefully, or feast in the shadows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧟 A ghost with goals manage hunger, reputation, and morality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐔 Steal, sell, or farm chickens to survive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵️‍♀️ Stealth gameplay with villager suspicion and shaman patrols</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌾 Farm-building and upgrade systems with spooky flair</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 Multiple endings based on your choices (moral, corrupted, or legendary)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎭 A darkly comedic story rooted in Thai folklore, with a twist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Vibrant isometric pixel art and haunting retro soundtrack</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661880/extras/943092214f032d52abe49eee40483c80.avif?t=1776427920\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why steal chickens… when you can build a farm?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>T-Ghoul</i>, you play as a mischievous Thai ghoul trying to survive in a modern village that fears her. Tired of haunting and hiding, she dreams of going legit by running her own chicken farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 2D isometric pixel-art horror-comedy blends survival, stealth, and simulation into a satirical take on Thai folklore. Sneak past shamans, manage your undead farm, build relationships with villagers (or betray them), and decide whether to embrace humanity or fully become a creature of the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you thrive peacefully, or feast in the shadows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧟 A ghost with goals manage hunger, reputation, and morality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐔 Steal, sell, or farm chickens to survive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵️‍♀️ Stealth gameplay with villager suspicion and shaman patrols</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌾 Farm-building and upgrade systems with spooky flair</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 Multiple endings based on your choices (moral, corrupted, or legendary)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎭 A darkly comedic story rooted in Thai folklore, with a twist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Vibrant isometric pixel art and haunting retro soundtrack</p>", "short_description": "A mischievous Thai ghoul trades haunting for farming in this 2D isometric horror-comedy. Steal, sell, or raise chickens, avoid shamans, and decide your fate in a ghost-filled village. Survive, thrive… or devour.", "supported_languages": "English, Thai<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661880/150c298beaf8ff270880f0cf4a1beb82de8d01bf/header.jpg?t=1776427920", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661880/228711ccfc65741070d5497c663f2b1ea63e6d49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776427920", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661880/228711ccfc65741070d5497c663f2b1ea63e6d49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776427920", "website": "https://t-ghoul.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core CPU (Intel/AMD @ 2.0 GHz or better)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics (Intel HD 4000 or better)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible sound card</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 or Ryzen 3 and above<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated GPU (NVIDIA GTX 660 / AMD Radeon HD 7870 or better)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 (High Sierra) or later<br>